# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [1.4] - 2018-05-06
### Added
- Added configurable transaction log generator for all MSISDNs.
- Added remaining balance check into update wallet query.
- Added properties LOG_FOR_ANY_MSISDN and LOG_FILE_CREATION_INTERVAL under Log Configuration section.

### Changed

### Deprecated

### Removed

### Fixed

### Security

## [1.3] - 2018-03-29
### Added
- Introducing call type id checker class [CallTypeChecker].
- Adding MySQL-Redis sync application configuration.
- Adding toString method to all configuration classes.
- Introducing CallType model class to facilitate CallTypeChecker.
- Adding configurable Redis functionality to query about subscriberservices and wallet information.
- Adding reloading feature for calltype table.
- Adding log monitoring server.

### Changed
- Number parsing exception block in PipeLineParser
- Adding redis key for subscriberservices and wallet tables.
- Adding default values to some configuration properties.
- Instead of dumping whole trace, we simply dumping reason with additional info to identify 
  why this error occurs.

### Deprecated


### Removed
- Removed configuration properties which are being hardly changed from cgw.ini.

### Fixed
- Dynamically setted BillingResponse enum's alpha-numeric value is not thread safe. So raw result code
  is being used.

### Security



